    "title": "Three SSCC students named to All-Ohio Academic Team - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Southern State Community College is pleased to announce that three current SSCC students have been named to the All-Ohio Academic Team. The students, joining other honorees from Ohio’s community college system, were honored with scholarships for their excellence in academics, leadership, and community service. A ceremony and luncheon to recognize this year’s award winners were held at the Ohio Statehouse on April 23 as part of Community College Month in Ohio. SSCC President Nicole Roades and PTK Advisor Sam Ginn joined the students and their parents at this special event. Read full article",
